  "authority": [
    "CurrentAdminSession internal constructor bound to SAME original CakeIdentity SessionID/AccountID/token and issuer, no DTO-created account grants",
    "Actual synchronous original session -> same named organisation mutex; active same-thread issuer recheck after org lock and immediately before durable Save",
    "Synchronous canonical policy read reuses entire prior EvaluateAsync body via EvaluateCurrent; no asynchronous provider under locked admission",
    "Read result recheck before return; successful durable mutation keeps original known commit outcome",
    "Async export releases locks during preparation and re-enters same issuer/current role/policy/org revision for claim and final output",
    "Original RunID retained before persistence/lease exit; failed/cancelled admitted original may record redacted terminal status/audit without current new output permission",
